hiddenone said:
@chalkdust - I guess RearHair20 is redundant, but I figured that some people may want to add horns to non-dragon characters, which is why I included it as beast ears.  RearHair 22 is needed though, since the horns went over the head spines if the horns were added as beast ears.
@LectroNyx- Unfortunately they don't affect the portraits, only the sprites.  I do plan on adding other creatures to the set, eventually.
Click to expand...
