@DragonSoftware - The hoods are set to work with the clothes, but if you look in the male files you should be able to find one of the hoods that's detached from the clothes.
A small update today, I made some tall sprite bases with MV heads.  No outfits (yet), but the normal hair fits them with just a little editing.
Happy game making!

hiddenone said:
@Kloe - Would the sink be a weapon, or an actual character (just imagine sinks in armor and sinks casting spells)?
@feckyeslife - If a piece has a matching portrait piece, it's because I was able to edit it from the default graphics (the horns come from one of the facesets).  I'm not very good at making those pieces, so I'll leave that to someone more skilled than myself.
Click to expand...
A sink casting spells! that'd be ultra super duper cool!

@SkySurfer - I've already mentioned it, but if a generator piece doesn't have a face part it's because I wasn't able to edit a different piece to work for it.  Making those parts isn't my forte, so I'll leave that to someone more skilled than I.
@Column - So a blank full-face mask?  That seems doable, I'll add it to my mask idea list.
