Restaff
, so I thought I'd dress some up for y'all to us.

@Azaarious - Feel free to edit the mask, and let me know what you do with it!  I love to see what people create with my pieces.
Centaurs aren't the only half-human, half-animal, creatures that need more love, so here are some templates so you can make your own lamia characters!
Happy game making!

@brunovisk2 - Making SV battler templates for the centaur and lamia are definitely on my to-do list, but it does take time to make them.
It's my birthday, so I thought I'd give y'all a little present!  I don't know why, but the first four characters in Actor3 didn't have matching SV battlers so I started working on those.  So far I've only completed actor3_2 and actor3_4, but I figured I'd share them now (hopefully I'll be able to get the other two done sometime this month).
Happy game making!

