Please make sure that the pieces are numbered in order (so no skipping numbers).  LolSheeps, my pieces are set so that if you download the kitchen sink pack you don't have to do anything, but if you grab one of the separate packs you'll probably need to renumber them.  ZetlasX3, the pieces aren't showing up because I changed the piece numbers to work with the newest update to the generator, and from the looks of your variations you don't have it yet.  So you'll need to either get the update or renumber my pieces.

Just like how
@sushibyte
explains, each generator piece needs to be in a specific sequential order so it shows up correctly and that each piece of that part is numbered the same or it will not work. The majority of
@hiddenone
's generator parts are already numbered, but if you've already added parts to the generator you're going to have to renumber them so they don't override the files already there. It's tedious, especially if you're like me who already added stuff to the vanilla generator.

